curately describes your highest earned degree? Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) Doctor of Education (EdD) Other Doctoral Degree (DSci, DAud, MD, etc.) Specialist's Degree (EdS) Professional Degree Juris Doctor Master's Degree Bachelor's Degree Associate's Degree Certificate * In which Academic Discipline is your highest earned degree? (Open Ended Question) In what areas do you hold any additional licenses or certifications valid in the State of Texas? (Open Ended Question) Have you ever been a student or an employee at UT Dallas? If yes, please indicate your UTD or Net ID. (Open Ended Question) Applicant Documents Required Documents Cover Letter/Letter of Application Teaching Philosophy Curriculum Vitae Optional Documents Writing Sample Other Document Relevant URL Veteran Employment Preference - Form DD-214 Teaching Evaluations Human Resources, 800 West Campbell Road, AD3.418 Richardson, TX 75080-3021 972.883.2221 Check Us Out on Social Media To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
